"guide.header-title" = "How-to Tutorial";
"guide.introduction.flow-body" = "1  Review the initial profile\n2  Choose its storage\n3  Sign in if needed\n4  Launch each profile from the profile list\n\n";
"guide.introduction.flow-heading" = "Overview\n";
"guide.introduction.prerequisite-body" = "If an existing environment is found, the first profile is registered automatically using its email address as the display name. If no existing environment is found, or when adding another profile, choose the storage after adding it. Projects and chats are never copied between profiles.";
"guide.introduction.prerequisite-heading" = "Before You Begin\n";
"guide.introduction.summary" = "ChatGPT Profile Manager gives each ChatGPT profile a separate storage location and lets those profiles run at the same time. It does not move or copy profiles or cloud projects.\n\n";
"guide.introduction.title" = "Welcome";
"guide.launcher.title" = "Launch Directly from the Dock";
"guide.launcher.generate-heading" = "Create a launch app\n";
"guide.launcher.generate-body" = "Open an isolated profile’s … menu and select Create Dock Launch App to create a launch app for that profile. After it is created, show it in Finder and drag it to the Dock. The existing ChatGPT environment is not included because the ChatGPT app already provides its own Dock option.\n\n";
"guide.launcher.icon-heading" = "Tell launchers apart\n";
"guide.launcher.icon-body" = "Each launch app uses the profile name, plus a two-letter icon with a different color. CamelCase and spaces, hyphens, and underscores are treated as word boundaries, so ShareFair, share-fair, and share_fair all become SF. A single word uses its first two characters. After renaming a profile, select Recreate Dock Launch App in the profile’s … menu to refresh the launch app’s name and icon.\n\n";
"guide.launcher.behavior-heading" = "What happens when you click it\n";
"guide.launcher.behavior-body" = "The launch app directly starts ChatGPT with the isolated profile's storage paths. If ChatGPT is not installed in a standard location, it falls back to ChatGPT Profile Manager for compatibility. Different profiles can run in parallel, but the same storage location cannot be launched twice. The existing ChatGPT environment is not handled by these launch apps. Launch apps use the profile name and are saved here:\n\n";
"guide.launcher.location-tree" = "~/Library/Application Support/\n└── ChatGPT Profile Manager/\n    └── Launchers/\n        └── ChatGPT <profile-name>.app";
"guide.mechanism.launch-body" = "The existing environment launches with ChatGPT’s default storage. Each isolated instance receives its own storage paths through environment variables and an argument. ChatGPT Profile Manager does not copy or move data; it selects a separate location for each running instance.\n\n";
"guide.mechanism.launch-heading" = "How Storage Is Selected at Launch\n";
"guide.mechanism.location-heading" = "Storage Location\n";
"guide.mechanism.location-tree" = "~/Library/Application Support/\n└── ChatGPT Profile Manager/\n    └── Profiles/\n        └── account-<display-name>-<short-ID>/\n            ├── CodexHome/\n            └── ElectronUserData/";
"guide.mechanism.paths-body" = "CODEX_HOME stores Codex settings, authentication, sessions, logs, and related data. CODEX_ELECTRON_USER_DATA_PATH and --user-data-dir select where the ChatGPT desktop app stores cookies, login state, and app data. Pointing both locations into the same isolated profile keeps each profile’s environment separate.\n\n";
"guide.mechanism.paths-heading" = "What Each Location Stores\n";
"guide.mechanism.storage-body" = "The existing ChatGPT environment is the storage ChatGPT normally uses. An isolated profile is dedicated storage that ChatGPT Profile Manager prepares for one account. Login state and app data stay separate for each account.\n\n";
"guide.mechanism.storage-heading" = "Two Types of Storage\n";
"guide.mechanism.title" = "How It Works and Where Data Is Stored";
"guide.mechanism.usage-body" = "The profile list shows the plan name when available. 5H is the five-hour usage window and Weekly is the weekly window. The 5H row shows the remaining percentage and reset time in 24-hour format. The Weekly row shows the remaining percentage, date, and time. If limit-reset credits are available, their count and expiration dates appear below the Weekly row, one expiration per line. Hover over a usage label to see the used percentage and full reset date. A dash appears when the Codex command is unavailable, the profile is not signed in, or usage data cannot be retrieved. This app does not save usage data or credentials in its settings.";
"guide.mechanism.usage-heading" = "Usage Limits\n";
"guide.next" = "Next";
"guide.organize.add-body" = "Repeat the same steps to add any number of profiles. After the existing environment is assigned, that option is disabled and additional profiles use isolated storage. To use an unregistered profile folder, select ‘Use an Existing Isolated Profile’ on the storage screen.\n\n";
"guide.organize.add-heading" = "Add Another Profile\n";
"guide.organize.list-body" = "The pencil icon next to a profile name changes only the display name. Drag a row to change only its position in the list.\n\n";
"guide.organize.list-heading" = "Organize the List\n";
"guide.organize.remove-body" = "Removing an isolated profile removes only its registration; the profile folder and its data remain. The profile assigned to the existing environment cannot be removed.";
"guide.organize.remove-heading" = "Unregister an Isolated Profile\n";
"guide.organize.title" = "Organize Profiles";
"guide.page.accessibility-label" = "Go to page {current} of {total}";
"guide.previous" = "Previous";
"guide.progress" = "Page {current} of {total}";
"guide.register.add-body" = "If the existing environment was not registered automatically, or to add another profile, select Add Profile and enter a name for the list. You can use a name other than the email address and add any number of profiles. Names must be between 1 and 60 characters and cannot be duplicated.";
"guide.register.add-heading" = "Add a Profile\n";
"guide.register.launch-body" = "Launch ChatGPT Profile Manager. If an existing environment is found, the first profile is registered automatically using its email address as the display name. Registration alone does not launch ChatGPT; the selected environment launches only when you select Launch in the profile list.\n\n";
"guide.register.launch-heading" = "Launch the App\n";
"guide.register.title" = "Register Profiles";
"guide.safety.launch-body" = "When using multiple profiles, launch ChatGPT with Launch in this app instead of the regular ChatGPT icon. Different profiles can run at the same time, while the same profile cannot be launched twice. A running profile is marked Running and its action changes to Open. Use the profile’s … menu to quit after checking for work in progress.\n\n";
"guide.safety.launch-heading" = "Where to Launch ChatGPT\n";
"guide.safety.registration-body" = "If an existing environment is found on first launch, it is registered automatically using the email address as its display name. You can change only the display name later with the pencil icon next to the profile name.\n\n";
"guide.safety.registration-heading" = "Initial Registration\n";
"guide.safety.title" = "Troubleshooting and Safe Use";
"guide.safety.warning-body" = "This is not an official OpenAI feature. Do not use it to circumvent account usage limits.";
"guide.safety.warning-heading" = "Important\n";
"guide.storage.existing-body" = "Use the projects, chats, settings, and login state from the ChatGPT environment you already use. This storage can be assigned to only one profile.\n\n";
"guide.storage.existing-heading" = "Use the Existing ChatGPT Environment\n";
"guide.storage.existing-isolated-body" = "Choose and register an existing profile folder. The folder is not copied or moved.";
"guide.storage.existing-isolated-heading" = "Use an Existing Isolated Profile\n";
"guide.storage.introduction" = "After entering a name, the app asks you to choose the storage this profile will use. Select one of the following three options.\n\n";
"guide.storage.new-body" = "Create a new storage location dedicated to this profile. Data from the existing environment is not copied.\n\n";
"guide.storage.new-heading" = "Create a New Isolated Profile\n";
"guide.storage.title" = "Choose Storage";
"guide.switch.login-body" = "The first time you launch a new isolated profile, sign in to the ChatGPT account you want to use with that storage. Its login state, projects, and chats are saved in the isolated profile. If you selected the existing environment, its current login state is used.\n\n";
"guide.switch.login-heading" = "First Sign-In\n";
"guide.switch.open-body" = "Choose a profile and select Launch. ChatGPT starts as a separate instance without quitting profiles that are already running. To protect profile data, the same storage location cannot be launched more than once. For a running profile, Launch changes to Open and brings its existing ChatGPT window to the front. Use the profile’s … menu to quit it.";
"guide.switch.open-heading" = "Launch Profiles in Parallel\n";
"guide.switch.title" = "Sign In and Launch";
"guide.window-title" = "How This App Works";
